 "summary": "The cross-face secant-error bound and the embedding theorems are new, and the coordinate-simplex helpers were moved rather than copied. Convexity, continuity, gluing, the antilipschitz perturbation and uniform convergence all go through located existing lemmas (`convex_convexHull`, `Convex.lipschitzOnWith_of_finite_closed_cover`, `AntilipschitzWith.add_sub_lipschitzWith`, `Continuous.eventually_norm_secantMap_sub_lt_edgewiseSubdivision`), and the closed-embedding theorem drops the open-star injectivity hypothesis of the existing `GlobalEmbedding` result rather than duplicating it.",
